# title: Everest
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 3
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A long capital-protected note paying a 2% yearly coupon and, at maturity, the rise of the worst of three stocks.
#
# Notional 1000, three years. Coupons are guaranteed; the capital is
# protected, and the worst performance is paid if positive.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)

2028-01-04  2029-01-04
    pays 1000 * 0.02

2030-01-04
    worst = min(spot(0) / s0, min(spot(1) / s1, spot(2) / s2))
    pays 1000 * (1.02 + max(worst - 1, 0))
